  "title": "Ada Lovelace",
  "summary": "Born Ada Byron in London in 1815, she met Charles Babbage in 1833 and later translated Luigi Menabrea's paper on his Analytical Engine into English. Her annotations, signed AAL and published in 1843, included Note G, a computation of Bernoulli numbers for the machine. She died in London in 1852.",
